Title: F1-M09 — The Foundry (briefing)
Credit: Staalfront
Author: Staalfront narrative team
Draft date: 2026-10-17

FADE IN:

INT. FORWARD COMMAND POST - DAWN

[[AMBIENCE: radio hiss, distant engines, wind against canvas]]
[[MUSIC: restrained military tension]]

A map of the operational area is spread across a table. CAPTAIN ELIAN and MIRA stand over it.

RUSK
(serious)
The foundry is turning out vehicles faster than our crews can repair the damage they cause.

[[SHOT: map]]
[[MAP: operational area, player start, objective route, enemy approach]]

MIRA
(measured)
A fuel depot sits outside the main wall. The production yard depends on it, but an armoured reserve is held underground.

CAPTAIN ELIAN
(firm)
Cut the fuel supply first, then destroy the production yard. Do not give the reserve time to assemble.

[[SFX: radio click]]
[[MUSIC: stop]]

FADE OUT.
